WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
Editing day.

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:03.400
Read each line out loud.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.620
Does it stand on its own?

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:07.700
Because it was raining.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.550
That’s a piece, not a sentence.

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:14.370
Does it run two sentences together with no joint?

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:18.440
Fix the piece, mend the joint, and say why.
